arcane-traitor-generic-intro = You are an agent sent by [color=darkred]the Syndicate[/color] on behalf of {$corporation}.
arcane-traitor-allegiances = Allegiances
arcane-traitor-notes = Assignment notes
arcane-traitor-more-info = Check the character menu for your objectives and more information.

arcane-traitor-traitor-corporations-dataset-1-intro = You are the specialist from Cybersun Industries.
arcane-traitor-traitor-corporations-dataset-1-uplink = You have been supplied the tools for the job in the form of a syndicate uplink.
arcane-traitor-traitor-corporations-dataset-1-allies = Fellow Cybersun operatives are to be trusted. Members of the MI13 organization can be trusted. All other syndicate agents are not to be trusted.
arcane-traitor-traitor-corporations-dataset-1-goal = Do not establish substantial presence on the designated facility, as larger incidents are harder to cover up.

arcane-traitor-traitor-corporations-dataset-2-intro = You are the Gorlex Marauder.
arcane-traitor-traitor-corporations-dataset-2-uplink = You have been provided with a syndicate uplink to accomplish your task.
arcane-traitor-traitor-corporations-dataset-2-allies = You may collaborate with any friends of the Syndicate coalition, but keep an eye on any of those Tiger punks if they do show up.
arcane-traitor-traitor-corporations-dataset-2-goal = Getting noticed is not an issue, and you may use any level of ordinance to get the job done. That being said, do not make this sloppy by dragging in random slaughter.

arcane-traitor-traitor-corporations-dataset-3-intro = You are the MI13 agent.
arcane-traitor-traitor-corporations-dataset-3-uplink = You have been provided with a syndicate uplink to accomplish your task.
arcane-traitor-traitor-corporations-dataset-3-allies = You are the only operative we are sending, any others are fake. All other syndicate agents are not to be trusted, with the exception of Cybersun specialists.
arcane-traitor-traitor-corporations-dataset-3-goal =  Avoid killing innocent personnel at all costs. You are not here to mindlessly kill people, as that would attract too much attention and is not our goal. Avoid detection at all costs.

arcane-traitor-traitor-corporations-dataset-4-intro = You are the Tiger Cooperative Fanatic.
arcane-traitor-traitor-corporations-dataset-4-uplink = You have been provided with a syndicate uplink from your friends at Cybersun Industries to prove yourself to the changeling hive. If you accomplish your tasks, you will be assimilated.
arcane-traitor-traitor-corporations-dataset-4-allies = Only the enlightened Tiger brethren can be trusted; all others must be expelled from this mortal realm!
arcane-traitor-traitor-corporations-dataset-4-goal = Remember the teachings of Hy-lurgixon; kill first, ask questions later!

arcane-traitor-traitor-corporations-dataset-6-intro = You are the ARC terrorist.
arcane-traitor-traitor-corporations-dataset-6-uplink = The Syndicate have graciously given one of their uplinks for your task.
arcane-traitor-traitor-corporations-dataset-6-allies = You may cooperate with other syndicate agents if you support our cause. Maybe you can convince the Bee Liberation Front agents to cooperate for once?
arcane-traitor-traitor-corporations-dataset-6-goal = The creatures of this world must be freed from the iron grasp of Nanotrasen, and you are their only hope!

arcane-traitor-traitor-corporations-dataset-7-intro = You are the Donk Co. infiltrator.
arcane-traitor-traitor-corporations-dataset-7-uplink = You have been provided with a syndicate uplink to accomplish your task.
arcane-traitor-traitor-corporations-dataset-7-allies = Members of Waffle Co. are to be killed on sight; they are not allowed to be on the station while we're around.
arcane-traitor-traitor-corporations-dataset-7-goal = We do not approve of mindless killing of innocent workers; get in, get done, get out is our motto.

arcane-traitor-traitor-corporations-dataset-8-intro = You are the Waffle Co. infiltrator.
arcane-traitor-traitor-corporations-dataset-8-uplink = You have been provided with a syndicate uplink to accomplish your task.
arcane-traitor-traitor-corporations-dataset-8-allies = Members of Donk Co. are to be killed on sight; they are not allowed to be on the station while we're around.
arcane-traitor-traitor-corporations-dataset-8-goal = You are not here for a station-wide demonstration. Again, other Waffle Co. infiltrators may be, so watch out. Your job is to only accomplish your objectives.
